<title>USA: Talladega Cty BOE, Ala., $3.650 mln won by Regions.</title>
<headline>Talladega Cty BOE, Ala., $3.650 mln won by Regions.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regions Inv. said it won $3.650 million of Talladega Cty BOE, Ala., capital outlay warrants, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 5.076 percent.</p>
</text>
